---
description: Compare issue-level agreement with operation receipt and customer acceptance evidence.
args:{issues:ServiceIssue[];actions:RecoveryAction[];receipts:EvidencePage[];choices:EvidencePage[]}
returns:ClosureComparison[]
---
For each issue match agreed outcome to the operation identity and authoritative completion receipt. Record residual obligation where only request or notice exists. Accept an alternative only from an explicit customer-choice record and authorized remedy. Keep unrelated issue closure intact.
